</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Groundwater depletion and sustainability of irrigation in the US High Plains and Central Valley</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Scanlon%20BR"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Bridget R Scanlon</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Bridget R Scanlon</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>Bureau of Economic Geology, Jackson School of Geosciences, University of Texas at Austin, Austin, TX 78713-8924;</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Scanlon%20BR"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Bridget R Scanlon</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>a,</sup><sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Faunt%20CC"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Claudia C Faunt</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Claudia C Faunt</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>b</sup>US Geological Survey, San Diego, CA 92101-0812;</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Faunt%20CC"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Claudia C Faunt</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>b</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Longuevergne%20L"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Laurent Longuevergne</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Laurent Longuevergne</span></h3>
<div class="p">
